875913"},{"id":9,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1409830/0b55cdfb94bdd0739c3d9cf97bfbb19af3b67168/ss_0b55cdfb94bdd0739c3d9cf97bfbb19af3b67168.1920x1080.jpg?t=1767875913","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1409830/0b55cdfb94bdd0739c3d9cf97bfbb19af3b67168/ss_0b55cdfb94bdd0739c3d9cf97bfbb19af3b67168.600x338.jpg?t=1767875913"}],"short_description":"Sons of Valhalla is a roguelike strategy game set in the Viking Age. Build fortresses, gather warriors, and lay siege to enemy strongholds, engaging in personal combat as you raid and conquer across England.","steam_appid":1409830,"support_info":{"email":"info@pixelchest.games","url":""},"supported_languages":"English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Korean, Polish, Russian, Traditional Chinese, Portuguese - Brazil, Simplified Chinese, Czech, Hungarian, Thai, Turkish, Ukrainian<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support","type":"game","website":"https://sov-game.com"}